From f8035f94fcd1241d4f0e07781ae06c91352e24f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rstmcsoch <300077786+rstmcsoch@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 06:09:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] redesign(admin): phase 3 pages, polish and QA

Applies the guide's page recipes to every admin screen:
- overview: banner with hex pattern and glow, six icon stat cards,
  People & accounts header row, System status as label/value rows
- users: export action in the page head, avatars, role/status/verified badges,
  tabular storage with a proportional bar, chevron pagination
- user detail: profile card, key-value cards, sessions before actions
- content: bulk toolbar, kind and status badges, engagement stat tiles,
  2-column editor grid, media rows, right-aligned save
- settings pages: field grids, 44x24 switches, colour swatches, 2-column label rows
- audit, safety, security matrix, analytics, exports, system, guide, error cards
- table scroll regions on Media and Security are now focusable and named
No text, control, action, route or data change beyond the recipe's own labels.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
